WEBVTT

00:02.900 --> 00:04.730
We can go home soon!

00:04.730 --> 00:07.490
I wanna get home! I wanna get home soon!

00:08.360 --> 00:09.450
Ah!

00:09.450 --> 00:11.700
To Snowfield!!

00:12.240 --> 00:13.530
This is...

00:13.530 --> 00:16.700
definitely beyond the confines
of ordinary Magecraft.

00:18.040 --> 00:19.660
Cavalryman... Rider?

00:27.840 --> 00:29.840
Such thrilling music!

00:29.840 --> 00:32.550
It was truly a wonderful experience!

00:33.550 --> 00:34.510
All right!

00:34.510 --> 00:37.010
First and foremost,
let's form an alliance with someone!

02:08.690 --> 02:11.820
So, you won't be going there?

02:11.820 --> 02:14.270
Due to the events from a
previous Holy Grail War,

02:14.270 --> 02:17.450
a Lord is not allowed onsite.

02:17.450 --> 02:19.410
That's what the Clock Tower decided.

02:20.120 --> 02:22.330
You have some new information?

02:22.330 --> 02:23.410
Yes.

02:23.410 --> 02:27.130
I thought you should be
the first person to know.

02:27.130 --> 02:27.960
Baleman.

02:27.960 --> 02:33.510
S-Several hours ago,
a certain indie band uploaded this video.

02:33.920 --> 02:37.680
First the news, now video streaming.

02:37.680 --> 02:39.140
Look! Right here!

02:41.600 --> 02:42.810
Sajyou?

02:44.930 --> 02:46.770
What's wrong, Ayaka?

02:46.770 --> 02:47.730
Nothing.

02:48.020 --> 02:49.650
You have an uneasy look on your face.

02:49.650 --> 02:52.440
If there's something worrying you,
don't hesitate to tell me.

02:52.780 --> 02:53.900
I said it's fine.

02:54.190 --> 02:56.700
Oh, perhaps you're tired?

02:56.700 --> 02:58.610
You weren't able to sleep
at the music club, either.

02:58.610 --> 02:59.660
Jeez!

02:59.660 --> 03:01.660
I have nothing but uncertainties!

03:01.660 --> 03:04.450
Isn't there another Master
hiding here or something?

03:04.790 --> 03:07.620
Right! This Magical Energy
enveloping the entire forest

03:07.620 --> 03:09.460
is almost like a bounded field!

03:10.170 --> 03:12.040
What if, maybe, they attack us?

03:13.550 --> 03:16.130
If they felt so inclined,
they would have done it long ago!

03:17.300 --> 03:19.640
How can you have so much faith?

03:19.930 --> 03:21.100
Huh?

03:21.100 --> 03:23.350
I can't see Saber anymore!

03:24.020 --> 03:28.390
Why did that weird Saber show up
instead of Altry?

03:28.390 --> 03:30.060
What did you use as the catalyst?

03:30.520 --> 03:35.940
They said the sheath
for the legendary sword was gone...

03:35.940 --> 03:39.860
so I used the box that it was sealed in.

03:39.860 --> 03:43.530
I totally thought we'd
be able to summon Altry!

03:43.870 --> 03:44.740
Jeez!

03:44.740 --> 03:46.950
This forest is annoying!

03:53.710 --> 03:54.550
Hello!

03:57.170 --> 03:59.220
What have you come to me for?

04:00.090 --> 04:02.430
I don't know what kind of being you are...

04:02.800 --> 04:06.060
but I wanted to make a request
to the first Servant I came across!

04:06.060 --> 04:08.060
Huh? Servant?

04:08.060 --> 04:10.390
Do you have any interest
in forming an alliance with us?

04:10.940 --> 04:12.860
I don't mind...

04:13.230 --> 04:16.360
but will my Master gain
anything from that?

04:16.730 --> 04:19.360
I'd like to talk to your Master, as well.

04:19.360 --> 04:21.570
Are they not here with you? Huh?

04:23.700 --> 04:25.200
What a wonderful Master.

04:25.830 --> 04:29.080
They're not particularly fond of humans.

04:29.080 --> 04:31.210
But your Master seems to be an exception.

04:31.870 --> 04:34.290
Perhaps because she's
not much like a Master.

04:34.290 --> 04:36.800
Well, actually she's not a Master at all.

04:37.210 --> 04:38.800
Let's get back on topic.

04:38.800 --> 04:40.630
I saw a monster last night.

04:40.970 --> 04:42.430
This Holy Grail War...

04:42.720 --> 04:45.170
has either gotten roped into
some tremendous trouble,

04:45.170 --> 04:46.560
or it's being used for something.

04:47.350 --> 04:51.010
In either case, why don't we
eliminate them together and start clean?

04:51.010 --> 04:52.290
The way things are going now,

04:52.290 --> 04:54.800
if I were to lose, I can't
say Ayaka will be safe

04:54.800 --> 04:57.070
even if she evacuates to the Church.

04:57.570 --> 05:01.030
You seem to cherish your
Master quite a bit.

05:01.740 --> 05:04.740
She got roped into this because of me.

05:04.740 --> 05:06.910
If I didn't take
responsibility for that...

05:06.910 --> 05:09.500
the people who inherited
lineage of my clan...

05:09.500 --> 05:10.580
and...

05:10.580 --> 05:13.170
the name of the great first king
will be tarnished.

05:13.710 --> 05:15.250
Interesting.

05:15.250 --> 05:20.470
You surely are a king yourself, but of
a different type than the king I know.

05:20.470 --> 05:23.630
Especially the part that you seem to have
an exceptional number of friends.

05:23.970 --> 05:27.600
Is that so? I'd think
you have more friends than I do.

05:28.390 --> 05:32.440
I believe that anything
living on this earth is a friend.

05:32.440 --> 05:35.810
Although my feelings are
often unreciprocated.

05:36.400 --> 05:39.780
But a close friend that I can disclose
what goes on in my heart to...

05:41.400 --> 05:43.740
That, I decided will be just one person.

05:44.740 --> 05:47.200
Woah, come now. Is this
negotiation a failure?

05:47.530 --> 05:48.410
Or is it...

05:48.990 --> 05:52.160
That close friend is quite a fussy guy.

05:52.710 --> 05:55.210
If you're weak, you'd just be killed.

05:55.960 --> 05:58.710
I'd like to test whether or not...

05:59.300 --> 06:00.710
you can fight against him.

06:01.010 --> 06:03.220
I love things that are easy to understand.

06:03.220 --> 06:05.510
I basically have to prove
my strength, right?

06:05.890 --> 06:08.600
H-Hold on! What are you guys—

06:08.970 --> 06:10.310
Don't worry, Ayaka.

06:11.270 --> 06:13.680
This is just a trial to form an alliance.

06:13.680 --> 06:14.520
Now...

06:15.270 --> 06:17.020
let's start this battle!

06:17.650 --> 06:19.150
<i>Hey, Brother!</i>

06:19.150 --> 06:21.280
<i>That Saber sword arrived.</i>

06:21.900 --> 06:25.950
This isn't a Noble Phantasm or anything.
It's just a decorated sword.

06:26.360 --> 06:28.730
But he supposedly destroyed
the Opera House

06:28.730 --> 06:30.910
with a single strike from that sword.

06:31.240 --> 06:34.040
A knight with red streaks
in his blond hair...

06:34.040 --> 06:36.580
This is most likely Lionheart.

06:36.580 --> 06:38.380
Yeah, <i>that </i>Lionheart.

06:38.750 --> 06:41.300
<i>I see, you conclude so, as well?</i>

06:41.300 --> 06:46.760
Yeah. Lionheart was a
total King Arthur freak.

06:46.760 --> 06:49.750
Some say he pretended to live
a fast life, but in reality,

06:49.750 --> 06:52.600
went on to search around
for King Arthur's fortune.

06:52.600 --> 06:54.850
<i>However, isn't he a hero from an era</i>

06:54.850 --> 06:57.900
<i>where the Mystics have
relatively thinned out?</i>

06:57.900 --> 06:59.480
Hey, Brother.

06:59.480 --> 07:05.110
Lionheart was called the "Wandering King"
in my era, ya know.

07:05.110 --> 07:07.760
<i>Indeed, it's said the time
he stayed within his country</i>

07:07.760 --> 07:11.410
<i>during his 10-year reign
was less than one year.</i>

07:11.410 --> 07:12.910
That's not what I mean!

07:12.910 --> 07:16.620
I'm talking about the border
between mythology and history.

07:16.620 --> 07:18.670
He's part of both eras...

07:18.670 --> 07:21.350
and the final king from
a time when Mystics

07:21.350 --> 07:25.010
like Elementals and Rune Magecraft
still openly endured.

07:28.220 --> 07:28.970
Loxley!

07:38.190 --> 07:41.020
You're quick. Is that
physical strengthening Magecraft?

07:41.020 --> 07:42.860
It's not mine, though.

07:49.360 --> 07:50.200
Did you...

07:50.490 --> 07:51.620
take lessons in fistfighting?

07:51.620 --> 07:54.200
It's a combination of techniques I saw
earlier in what they call "movies"...

07:54.200 --> 07:56.370
along with my combat style!

08:03.090 --> 08:06.050
Such mobility despite that. Amazing.

08:06.960 --> 08:09.050
I'll be a bit more serious...

08:09.300 --> 08:10.800
as a Lancer-class.

08:16.140 --> 08:17.270
I'm Saber!

08:17.270 --> 08:18.270
Nice to meet you!

08:48.210 --> 08:50.800
I guess making do
with shallow knowledge won't work.

08:51.930 --> 08:54.260
From here, as a Saber-class...

08:54.550 --> 08:55.970
I shall use my sword!

08:56.350 --> 08:58.310
I've always wanted to do this once.

08:58.310 --> 09:01.170
Mimicking the Knight of
the Lake who defeated

09:01.170 --> 09:03.730
his enemies with a branch he picked up...

09:04.020 --> 09:06.230
saying, "A knight does
not die empty-handed."

09:06.900 --> 09:10.700
Hey Brother, let me tell
you an interesting tale!

09:10.700 --> 09:14.450
Just how crazy he was for King Arthur...

09:14.450 --> 09:21.330
Things got so bad that he named everything
he owned after that sacred sword.

09:22.040 --> 09:25.690
His sword, of course,
but also a knife, parchment,

09:25.690 --> 09:28.170
even a stick that was lying about.

09:28.880 --> 09:30.760
<i>This sword is...</i>

09:32.380 --> 09:35.430
<i>a road to glory, seeking a miracle!</i>

09:36.350 --> 09:39.850
<i>A crystallization of
faith honoring that will!</i>

09:40.770 --> 09:42.690
<i>Sadly enough, the noble dream...</i>

09:44.690 --> 09:48.070
<i>leads to the ends unhindered by anyone!</i>

09:53.490 --> 09:55.780
<i>Engraved once again...</i>

09:55.780 --> 09:58.240
<i>this sword is the one and only...</i>

09:59.870 --> 10:01.370
<i>Ex...</i>

10:02.500 --> 10:04.670
<i>calibur!</i>

10:17.970 --> 10:19.430
Come on now.

10:20.430 --> 10:23.270
That looks useful for cracking walnuts.

10:24.100 --> 10:26.980
This much power with a tree branch, huh?

10:27.520 --> 10:29.570
Do I pass the test?

10:29.570 --> 10:33.110
It seems you haven't unleashed
even half of your strength.

10:33.610 --> 10:35.450
You are strong.

10:35.860 --> 10:37.780
Though I don't know...

10:37.780 --> 10:39.280
what my friend would say.

10:39.950 --> 10:42.910
Ayaka! We have safely formed an alliance!

10:42.910 --> 10:43.790
Safely?

10:44.620 --> 10:46.460
You guys were trying to kill each other.

10:46.460 --> 10:49.750
Well, there are trials out in the world
that you risk your life for.

10:50.630 --> 10:51.710
Give me a break!

10:52.710 --> 10:54.840
Please don't be angry at him.

10:54.840 --> 10:57.550
He was being reckless for your sake.

10:58.180 --> 11:02.010
You know... do people say
you're terrible at reading the room?

11:02.470 --> 11:04.730
The gods often said so.

11:04.730 --> 11:06.690
Like when I defeated a bull.

11:06.690 --> 11:10.610
Defeated a bull?
Can you tell me that story in detail?

11:10.610 --> 11:13.110
What kind of bull? How and what did you—

11:13.110 --> 11:14.110
Ow!

11:14.110 --> 11:15.280
Please stop, Ayaka!

11:15.570 --> 11:16.650
Ouch! Ouch!

11:16.650 --> 11:18.530
It was my fault!

11:19.280 --> 11:21.780
Why would you do something like that?

11:21.780 --> 11:23.540
Why, you ask?

11:23.540 --> 11:28.000
I understand that you're trying
to do something for someone like me...

11:28.460 --> 11:29.210
but...

11:29.750 --> 11:31.960
I didn't ask you to do that!

11:32.420 --> 11:33.450
I told you, right?

11:33.450 --> 11:35.420
I'm going to look after
you on my own will.

11:35.840 --> 11:37.300
If you need Magical Energy,

11:37.300 --> 11:41.550
you can use Magecraft or whatever
and turn me into a puppet!

11:41.550 --> 11:43.890
But you trusted...

11:44.180 --> 11:45.100
someone like me.

11:46.310 --> 11:49.560
I appreciate what you did. I do. But...

11:51.480 --> 11:53.440
I'm not worthy of something like that.

11:54.190 --> 11:56.530
I don't deserve to be
protected by someone...

11:56.530 --> 11:59.410
or to be trusted.

12:03.370 --> 12:06.620
Hey, do you know about Little Red Riding
Hood of the Semina Apartments?

12:06.910 --> 12:10.630
A married couple and a girl
moved in next to Mr. A.

12:11.130 --> 12:15.630
The girl was being abused
and always hid her wounds with a red hood.

12:15.630 --> 12:18.630
That girl had been asking Mr. A
at the elevator...

12:18.630 --> 12:21.010
"Hey, can you push the button?"

12:21.010 --> 12:23.640
One day, that family
attempted murder-suicide.

12:23.640 --> 12:25.930
The girl sought help,
but Mr. A ignored her,

12:25.930 --> 12:27.890
thinking it had nothing to do with him.

12:27.890 --> 12:29.460
From the day the girl went missing,

12:29.460 --> 12:31.650
the sound of someone knocking
on the door echoed around.

12:31.650 --> 12:33.650
When Mr. A finally opened that door...

12:34.320 --> 12:36.650
Hey, can you push the button?

12:34.320 --> 12:36.650
"HEY, CAN YOU PUSH THE BUTTON?"

12:36.940 --> 12:40.360
I heard that's based on an incident
that actually happened.

12:41.240 --> 12:44.370
What happened in the end again?

12:44.370 --> 12:45.870
Didn't they end up missing?

12:45.870 --> 12:47.870
STOP

12:46.410 --> 12:48.620
I've heard an ending
that they fled overseas.

12:49.330 --> 12:53.130
Maybe they're still running away
from Little Red Riding Hood to this day!

12:53.880 --> 12:56.630
You're being so kind to me like this...

12:56.630 --> 12:58.880
but I'm sure I'll betray others again.

12:58.880 --> 13:02.340
I might sell you to the
enemy and flee by myself!

13:03.140 --> 13:05.600
You might sell me to the enemy?

13:05.850 --> 13:08.810
Ayaka, you really do worry
about the little things.

13:09.520 --> 13:12.190
Little things?

13:12.690 --> 13:14.440
It happens often.

13:14.440 --> 13:18.440
I was almost sold off to Rome
by my own little brother.

13:20.820 --> 13:23.820
That... has nothing to do with me!

13:24.490 --> 13:25.780
It does involve you!

13:26.580 --> 13:30.290
I have lived a life where it's no longer
a surprise for anyone to betray me.

13:30.870 --> 13:31.790
Can it be...

13:31.790 --> 13:34.790
that you have mistaken me for a good man?

13:35.750 --> 13:37.550
I don't know.

13:37.550 --> 13:40.010
Besides, what you have done doesn't...

13:40.920 --> 13:42.430
War.

13:44.050 --> 13:47.470
That was all I could do.

13:48.390 --> 13:54.020
People forming an alliance with us
shouldn't be making such solemn faces.

13:55.980 --> 13:58.770
If you'd like, have some, too.

13:59.940 --> 14:01.490
Wh-Why is she here?

14:02.530 --> 14:03.700
You lot...

14:03.990 --> 14:05.570
will defeat the monster?

14:06.240 --> 14:08.030
If it harms people!

14:08.950 --> 14:12.870
Lionheart, I have heard about you.

14:13.620 --> 14:18.340
How you fought such monsters
together with one of our leaders. And...

14:19.050 --> 14:22.050
what a terrifying man you used to be.

14:22.590 --> 14:25.800
My objective differs from you.

14:25.800 --> 14:29.060
However, I must defeat that monster first.

14:29.430 --> 14:32.520
Then, it's a temporary ceasefire.

14:32.890 --> 14:37.480
Actually, there is a monster
I want to rid from this city, as well.

14:38.230 --> 14:43.440
The monster you speak of seems
even more troublesome than Dead Apostles.

14:44.030 --> 14:46.030
That's not necessarily true.

14:46.030 --> 14:52.040
For now, it's just a black curse
and a dark brown clump of mud.

14:52.620 --> 14:56.710
If those two fused together
and seeped into the Holy Grail...

14:57.120 --> 15:02.340
this planet itself might be
in a little bit of danger.

15:03.010 --> 15:07.340
It seems my friend has found
a good partner to warm up with.

15:07.720 --> 15:11.560
Tiné, work up plenty of
Magical Energy for now.

15:11.560 --> 15:16.100
Even I can't imagine just how much
I will be spending from hereon out.

15:16.560 --> 15:19.230
Please use your powers
as much as you wish.

15:19.230 --> 15:21.360
Even if my body were to perish.

15:21.730 --> 15:23.570
Don't speak of such nonsense.

15:24.440 --> 15:28.860
If you are worried
that the cavalry girl made light of you...

15:28.860 --> 15:31.450
that is called "audacity."

15:32.290 --> 15:34.420
No matter your resolve,

15:34.420 --> 15:38.540
when faced with a powerful opponent,
a child is still a child.

15:38.540 --> 15:39.460
However...

15:39.830 --> 15:42.210
I am the leader of the
guardians of this land.

15:42.550 --> 15:44.810
I obtained my power by
sacrificing the lives

15:44.810 --> 15:47.430
of my 12 elder brothers
and nine elder sisters...

15:47.430 --> 15:52.050
as well as my own body.

15:52.430 --> 15:57.730
This life exists only to regain Snowfield,
which is the earnest wish of my clan.

15:58.440 --> 16:00.570
When opposing a proud warrior,

16:00.980 --> 16:05.190
they will respect and fight you
regardless of age or appearance.

16:05.740 --> 16:09.430
However, though you may
have gathered your resolve,

16:09.430 --> 16:12.120
I can't quite say you are a proud one yet.

16:12.910 --> 16:16.910
Those who lack self-esteem
will lack it even in old age.

16:17.620 --> 16:19.830
Self-esteem, you say?

16:20.170 --> 16:23.040
On that point, you are fortunate!

16:23.960 --> 16:27.720
Even if temporary,
you are one of my subjects.

16:27.720 --> 16:30.220
In a few days, the fact
that you were able to sear

16:30.220 --> 16:33.010
my glory into memory will
be something to be proud of!

16:33.970 --> 16:35.060
Yes!

16:36.020 --> 16:37.390
There's no doubt about it.

16:37.390 --> 16:40.390
Her hair color is different,
but that is Ayaka Sajyou.

16:40.390 --> 16:42.810
I informed you the other day, right?

16:42.810 --> 16:46.860
That someone who is on-site
has seen one of your apprentices, Lord.

16:46.860 --> 16:49.780
And by that, you didn't mean Flat?

16:49.780 --> 16:51.530
We meant her.

16:51.530 --> 16:56.040
It's true that Sajyou was a part
of my class for about a month.

16:56.040 --> 16:57.200
No...

16:57.200 --> 17:00.410
it's faster to confirm
it with her directly.

17:02.670 --> 17:04.170
Let's confirm the directive!

17:04.920 --> 17:09.220
For now, we will form an alliance until
the three threats have been dealt with.

17:09.220 --> 17:10.720
Is that fine?

17:11.090 --> 17:12.390
Right.

17:12.390 --> 17:15.160
My top priority is still
the safety of my Master,

17:15.160 --> 17:17.770
so I can't move out of
this forest just yet.

17:18.600 --> 17:22.480
Then I would like to find
a base with some bedding.

17:22.480 --> 17:25.440
For that, I know of a place.

17:25.820 --> 17:27.690
The spot where I was summoned.

17:28.440 --> 17:29.440
Oh!

17:29.440 --> 17:31.820
Ayaka should be able to rest here!

17:32.410 --> 17:35.780
Phew, I'm so glad! Rest is important!

17:33.820 --> 17:35.780
Saber... You know...

17:36.080 --> 17:37.030
Someone's here.

17:37.410 --> 17:38.200
What?

17:38.200 --> 17:40.160
Ayaka! Head to a place where you can hide!

17:40.540 --> 17:41.960
Huh? H-Hold on!

17:45.840 --> 17:46.670
Run for it!

17:46.670 --> 17:47.750
If you stay here—

17:50.460 --> 17:51.670
Why do you stop me?

17:52.090 --> 17:54.240
This guy told Ayaka to run for it.

17:54.240 --> 17:56.140
We might be able to talk
it out with him, right?

17:56.930 --> 18:00.100
I'm a Saber-class Servant.

18:00.600 --> 18:01.850
Nice meeting you!

18:01.850 --> 18:02.560
For now...

18:02.940 --> 18:05.690
can you listen to what we have to say?

18:05.690 --> 18:09.030
This over here is my
Master... well, not quite.

18:09.030 --> 18:09.860
Huh?

18:11.860 --> 18:13.240
Ayaka?

18:15.160 --> 18:16.740
<i>Are you going to seriously look for it?</i>

18:17.620 --> 18:19.700
<i>This so-called fortune of King Arthur?</i>

18:19.950 --> 18:21.000
<i>Of course!</i>

18:21.000 --> 18:22.870
<i>As long as I find something,
I don't care what.</i>

18:22.870 --> 18:25.290
<i>It would be the best
if that was Excalibur!</i>

18:33.590 --> 18:36.800
<i>Hey there, amusing, pleasant folks!</i>

18:36.800 --> 18:39.810
<i>You jumped right into the trap
I set up without any doubt!</i>

18:39.810 --> 18:43.140
<i>My utmost respect for you lot
who came all the way here!</i>

18:43.810 --> 18:45.440
<i>Who are you?</i>

18:45.440 --> 18:47.150
<i>Thank you for asking!</i>

18:47.810 --> 18:50.480
<i>My name is Saint Germain.</i>

18:50.480 --> 18:53.110
<i>I am your guide, your advisor...</i>

18:53.400 --> 18:54.570
<i>your prophet...</i>

18:55.030 --> 18:56.530
<i>and a simple con man.</i>

18:57.110 --> 18:58.620
<i>Amusing.</i>

18:58.620 --> 19:01.740
<i>What kind of fantasy will
you deceive me with?</i>

19:02.290 --> 19:04.960
<i>My hat's off to the great future king.</i>

19:05.750 --> 19:10.420
<i>However, I am not the one
who will deceive you.</i>

19:10.840 --> 19:14.300
<i>Faced with the numerous Mystics
that created King Arthur...</i>

19:14.300 --> 19:18.640
<i>you will attempt to deceive yourself.</i>

19:19.010 --> 19:24.100
<i>My eternal regards to the you
within the depths of your eyes, as well.</i>

19:29.310 --> 19:30.900
You're finally up.

19:31.440 --> 19:33.610
Do you hurt anywhere?

19:35.900 --> 19:38.320
Saber, do you like King Arthur?

19:38.910 --> 19:41.410
Ayaka, are you also a fan of King Arthur?

19:41.410 --> 19:44.040
I think King Arthur's great, too!

19:44.040 --> 19:46.370
That's not what I meant.

19:46.370 --> 19:47.920
Oh, I see.

19:48.620 --> 19:51.380
It's not dawn yet. You
should rest a bit more.

19:52.460 --> 19:53.590
You know...

19:54.260 --> 19:56.340
sorry about earlier.

19:56.800 --> 19:59.300
Was there something
you need to apologize for?

19:59.760 --> 20:04.120
Well... how I yelled, pulled your hair,

20:04.120 --> 20:06.980
shoved my selfishness at you...
all sorts of stuff.

20:07.440 --> 20:09.600
Such trivial things.

20:09.600 --> 20:12.230
No, I should apologize, too.

20:12.230 --> 20:15.570
I didn't think about your feelings and
revealed my name without permission

20:15.570 --> 20:16.990
and asked for an alliance.

20:17.610 --> 20:20.450
You don't need to apologize about that!

20:20.450 --> 20:24.160
Whatever you do, I won't say
it's none of your business anymore.

20:24.540 --> 20:28.410
But, at the least, tell me
if you're doing something dangerous.

20:28.410 --> 20:29.920
I'd like to at least try to stop you.

20:30.290 --> 20:34.300
And I'd be troubled if you died on your
own and I couldn't tell you "Thank you."

20:34.300 --> 20:38.510
Right. I have always troubled someone.

20:38.970 --> 20:42.550
I don't know your "always."
And that's not what I mean.

20:42.550 --> 20:45.640
This is me being selfish, too.

20:47.020 --> 20:48.140
All good?

20:48.140 --> 20:49.100
Who is it?

20:49.600 --> 20:51.400
My husband is acting weird!

20:51.400 --> 20:54.320
He's saying how he's not
going to leave the city!

20:54.320 --> 20:56.530
Oh? I thought you already clocked out.

20:57.190 --> 20:59.990
I'm sorry. I forgot something!

21:00.400 --> 21:02.450
I see. Be careful.

21:02.450 --> 21:04.450
All sorts of things are happening lately.

21:04.780 --> 21:06.910
But good things have happened, too.

21:06.910 --> 21:10.460
Tsubaki's condition is very stable today.

21:10.460 --> 21:14.710
I'm worried about that scar on her hand
that looks like a tattoo, though.

21:15.090 --> 21:16.050
Oh?

21:17.420 --> 21:18.590
<i>Mr. Jack...</i>

21:18.590 --> 21:22.220
<i>This was the source of
the black fog after all.</i>

21:22.760 --> 21:26.140
<i>Yes. Now I can feel it for myself.</i>

21:26.140 --> 21:28.720
<i>You are a superb Mage.</i>

21:29.100 --> 21:32.350
<i>But... I think we should
head back for now.</i>

21:32.730 --> 21:35.980
<i>It was a fog up until now,
but that's a waterfall.</i>

21:35.980 --> 21:38.030
<i>It's in a different league!</i>

21:38.030 --> 21:40.440
<i>Why don't we use a bomb
on the entire hospital—</i>

21:40.440 --> 21:43.110
<i>Y-You can't do something like that!</i>

21:43.110 --> 21:46.660
<i>We don't even know
if that Master is friend or foe!</i>

21:47.660 --> 21:48.910
<i>Right.</i>

21:48.910 --> 21:50.870
<i>Let's reorganize for now.</i>

21:51.460 --> 21:52.330
<i>Okay!</i>

21:52.750 --> 21:54.880
<i>If I went through with it...</i>

21:54.880 --> 21:57.000
<i>I would no longer be a murderer...</i>

21:57.000 --> 21:59.460
<i>but something else.</i>

22:00.010 --> 22:02.130
Just now, someone...

22:02.130 --> 22:02.930
no...

22:03.380 --> 22:05.850
<i>something</i> visited.

22:07.510 --> 22:10.020
EPISODE 6
